# mode=menus cell: 820x1180,touch, carried save (behaves as fresh per #273).
# README's cap claim -- "one or two tanks, one to three healers... a third
# tank or a fourth healer cannot be selected... the entry is drawn locked" --
# needs a 25-player roster to actually bind, and a fresh save only opens
# 10-normal. Use the known invite-hash recipe (open a boss link, back, raid)
# to reach a real 25-heroic setup, then open the composition screen and look
# for a locked slot -- no prior session has tapped enough slots to find one.
open #b=marrow&s=25&h=1
targets
tap back
tap raid
targets
shot raidsetup25

tap next
targets
shot classpick25

tap compose
targets
ui
shot compose25
